<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome</h1>
    <p>"Welcome to The Joel Hilton Film Collection! This site is dedicated to showcasing Joel's curated collection of movies that meet his high standards. As a Film Studies minor, movie reviewer for ClearPlay, and the host of the Baconsale podcast, Joel has an extensive knowledge and love for cinema. Whether it's the latest blockbuster or a timeless classic, only the most worthy films make it into his collection. Explore the site to learn more about Joel, his movie collection, and how you can contribute to expanding it!"</p>
